# Track source and aircraft input data only.
# Ignore executables, objects, PDFs, solver output, and Results.

# --- Results ---
Results/
**/Results/

# --- PDFs ---
*.pdf

# --- Executables and compiled binaries ---
*.exe
*.osx
*.bin
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.mex*
*.out
*.app
*.x
*.elf

# Named solver binaries (no extension)
